# Create Angular Application with 4 Components (STEP BY STEP)

We will create:

1. Home Component
2. About Component
3. Contact Component
4. Services Component

---

# STEP 1 — Install NodeJS

Check installation:

```bash
node -v
```

Check npm:

```bash
npm -v
```

---

# STEP 2 — Install Angular CLI

Open terminal in VS Code.

Run:

```bash
npm install -g @angular/cli
```

Check:

```bash
ng version
```

---

# STEP 3 — Create Angular Project

Run:

```bash
ng new myapp
```

It asks:

```text
Would you like to add Angular routing?
```

Type:

```text
y
```

Then:

```text
Which stylesheet format?
```

Choose:

```text
CSS
```

---

# STEP 4 — Open Project

```bash
cd myapp
```

Open in VS Code:

```bash
code .
```

---

# STEP 5 — Create 4 Components

Run these commands ONE BY ONE:

```bash
ng generate component home
```

```bash
ng generate component about
```

```bash
ng generate component contact
```

```bash
ng generate component services
```

Shortcut:

```bash
ng g c home
ng g c about
ng g c contact
ng g c services
```

---

# STEP 6 — Open `src/app/app.html`

DELETE everything inside.

Paste this:

```html
<h1 align="center">Angular Application</h1>

<hr>

<app-home></app-home>

<hr>

<app-about></app-about>

<hr>

<app-contact></app-contact>

<hr>

<app-services></app-services>
```

---

# STEP 7 — Open Home Component

File:

```text
src/app/home/home.html
```

Paste:

```html
<h2>Home Component</h2>

<p>Welcome to Angular Home Page</p>
```

---

# STEP 8 — Open About Component

File:

```text
src/app/about/about.html
```

Paste:

```html
<h2>About Component</h2>

<p>This is About Page</p>
```

---

# STEP 9 — Open Contact Component

File:

```text
src/app/contact/contact.html
```

Paste:

```html
<h2>Contact Component</h2>

<p>Email: test@gmail.com</p>
```

---

# STEP 10 — Open Services Component

File:

```text
src/app/services/services.html
```

Paste:

```html
<h2>Services Component</h2>

<ul>
  <li>Web Development</li>
  <li>Angular Development</li>
  <li>UI Design</li>
</ul>
```

---

# STEP 11 — RUN APPLICATION

Open terminal.

Run:

```bash
ng serve
```

OR

```bash
ng serve --open
```

---

# STEP 12 — Open Browser

Open:

```text
http://localhost:4200
```

You will see all 4 components.

---

# PROJECT STRUCTURE

```text
myapp
│
└── src
    └── app
        ├── home
        ├── about
        ├── contact
        ├── services
        ├── app.html
        └── app.ts
```

